    <Folder>
      <name>The Cabot Trail (Day 5, clockwise)</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>The Cabot Trail (Day 5, clockwise)</name>
        <description>Day 5, driven clockwise from Baddeck: Margaree, Chéticamp, Pleasant Bay, Cape North, Ingonish, and around St. Ann's Bay back to Baddeck. About 186 mi, so plan a full day with stops. Fill up before the Highlands, expect patchy cell service, and watch for moose at dusk. Route lines and pin locations (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (openstreetmap.org/copyright). Routed with OSRM.</description>
